    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49247263887712256
    m_Localized: Poenostavljen dnevnik obrokov
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49247263887712257
    m_Localized: "Katere so bile glavne zna\u010Dilnosti va\u0161e jedi?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49247263887712258
    m_Localized: Ime ali opis (neobvezno)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49247263887712259
    m_Localized: "Npr.: Solata iz le\u010De in zelenjave"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49260137687277568
    m_Localized: "Misija zaklju\u010Dena!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49260137691471872
    m_Localized: "Izziv zaklju\u010Den!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49265187998392320
    m_Localized: Navade in trajnostna prehrana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380160
    m_Localized: Hrana brez mesa / vegetarijanska hrana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380161
    m_Localized: "Nadomestki \u017Eivil (Swaps)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380162
    m_Localized: Prehrana in zdravje
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380163
    m_Localized: "Porcija zau\u017Eitih stro\u010Dnic"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380164
    m_Localized: 100 % rastlinski / veganski obrok
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380165
    m_Localized: "Uravnote\u017Een obrok (\xBD zelenjave, \xBC beljakovin, \xBC ogljikovih
      hidratov)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380166
    m_Localized: "Tradicionalna ali polnozrnata \u017Eita"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380167
    m_Localized: Gomolj ali nadomestna osnovna hrana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380168
    m_Localized: "\u0160tevilo odmerkov mesa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380169
    m_Localized: "Porcija sve\u017Ee zelenjave ali solate"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380170
    m_Localized: "100 % polnozrnati kruh ali \u017Eitni izdelki"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380171
    m_Localized: Obrok, bogat z vlakninami
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380172
    m_Localized: Brez dodane soli pri mizi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380173
    m_Localized: "Zdrave ma\u0161\u010Dobe (olj\u010Dno olje, ore\u0161ki)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589228380174
    m_Localized: Brez dodanih sladkorjev ali industrijskih sladil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589232574464
    m_Localized: 100 % rastlinski obrok ali obrok brez mesa?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589232574465
    m_Localized: "Ali je vsebovala sve\u017Eo zelenjavo ali stro\u010Dnice?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589232574466
    m_Localized: "Trajnostna jed ali alternativna \u017Eitna vrsta?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49269589232574467
    m_Localized: 'Izberite izvedeno zamenjavo:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49495302372057088
    m_Localized: "Obrok in napredek sta bila uspe\u0161no zabele\u017Eena!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49525565470793728
    m_Localized: "Izberite vsaj eno mo\u017Enost obroka."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49555340042166272
    m_Localized: Urejanje poenostavljenega dnevnika obrokov
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49555340046360576
    m_Localized: Shrani spremembe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49555340046360577
    m_Localized: "Obrok uspe\u0161no posodobljen!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49560392702091264
    m_Localized: "\U0001F969 -> \U0001F957 Govedina s stro\u010Dnicami"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49560392706285568
    m_Localized: "\U0001F969 -> \U0001F357 Govedina s pi\u0161\u010Dancem"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49560392710479872
    m_Localized: "\U0001F969 -> \U0001F437 Govedina s svinjino"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49560392710479873
    m_Localized: "\U0001F437 -> \U0001F957 Svinjina s stro\u010Dnicami"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49560392710479874
    m_Localized: "\U0001F437 -> \U0001F357 Svinjina s pi\u0161\u010Dancem"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49560392710479875
    m_Localized: "\U0001F357 -> \U0001F957 Pi\u0161\u010Danec s stro\u010Dnicami"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49560392710479876
    m_Localized: "\U0001F964 -> \U0001F4A7 Sladka pija\u010Da z vodo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49560392710479877
    m_Localized: "\U0001F36A -> \U0001F34E Prigrizek s sadjem / ore\u0161\u010Dki"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49560392714674176
    m_Localized: "\U0001F963 -> \U0001F33E Sladkani kosmi\u010Di z ovsom"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49560392718868480
    m_Localized: "\U0001F355 -> \U0001F372 Predelana hrana z doma\u010Do"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49560392718868481
    m_Localized: "\U0001F32D -> \U0001FAD8 Predelano meso s stro\u010Dnicami"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49593946022600704
    m_Localized: "\u26A1 Odpri poenostavljen dnevnik obrokov"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49870781398638592
    m_Localized: "\u0160e vedno morate dokon\u010Dati svoj profil. Ali ga \u017Eelite
      dokon\u010Dati zdaj?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49870781402832896
    m_Localized: "Va\u0161a za\u010Detna anketa o prehranjevalnih navadah \u0161e
      vedno \u010Daka. Ali jo \u017Eelite izpolniti zdaj?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49870781402832897
    m_Localized: "Dokon\u010Daj profil"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49870781402832898
    m_Localized: Izpolni anketo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49915767645265920
    m_Localized: Moji cilji
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49915767645265921
    m_Localized: "Pozdravljeni! Da bi prilagodili va\u0161o izku\u0161njo, bi radi
      spoznali va\u0161e interese in cilje glede trajnosti in prehrane. V naslednjih
      korakih lahko izberete teme, ki vas najbolj zanimajo. Kadar koli jih lahko
      spremenite!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49915767645265922
    m_Localized: Prek te aplikacije bi rad prevzel bolj trajnostno prehrano z manj
      mesa in odkrivanjem alternativnih virov beljakovin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49915767645265923
    m_Localized: "Prek te aplikacije bi rad razumel okoljski vpliv svojih prehranskih
      izbir (npr. oglji\u010Dni in vodni odtis) ter tako u\u017Eival bolj trajnostno."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49915767645265924
    m_Localized: "S pomo\u010Djo te aplikacije bi rad izvedel, od kod prihaja moja
      hrana in kako se prideluje, da bi lahko izbiral \u010Dim manj predelane \u017Eivilske
      izdelke, ve\u010D lokalnih \u017Eivil, podpiral okolju prijazno kmetijstvo,
      skrbel za dobro po\u010Dutje \u017Eivali in/ali izbiral izdelke pravi\u010Dne
      trgovine."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49915767645265925
    m_Localized: "Prek te aplikacije bi se rad nau\u010Dil izbirati izdelke z bolj
      okolju prijazno embala\u017Eo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49915767645265926
    m_Localized: "Prek te aplikacije bi rad zmanj\u0161al koli\u010Dino zavr\u017Eene
      hrane z bolj\u0161im na\u010Drtovanjem obrokov in ponovno uporabo ostankov."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49915767645265927
    m_Localized: "Prek te aplikacije bi rad razumel prehransko vrednost svoje prehrane
      in sprejemal bolj zdrave odlo\u010Ditve (npr. ve\u010D beljakovin, vlaknin
      in vitaminov ter manj sladkorja in soli)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49915767645265928
    m_Localized: "Za zaklju\u010Dek izberite vsaj en cilj."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49915767645265929
    m_Localized: Moji cilji
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49923301089206272
    m_Localized: "Svojih ciljev trajnostnosti \u0161e niste izbrali. Ali jih \u017Eelite
      zdaj nastaviti?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49923301093400576
    m_Localized: Nastavi cilje
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49931095037173762
    m_Localized: "Va\u0161 izdelek {0} se bo kmalu iztekel. Poskrbite, da ga porabite!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4008881209995690412
  - m_Id: 49931095032979456
    m_Localized: Kaj si danes jedel?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49931095037173760
    m_Localized: "Ne pozabi bele\u017Eiti svojih obrokov, da bo\u0161 lahko spremljal
      svoje navade."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49931095037173761
    m_Localized: Obvestilo o shrambi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49940717588439040
    m_Localized: "Izziv uspe\u0161no zaklju\u010Den!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49940717588439041
    m_Localized: "Prednastavljenih elementov ni bilo mogo\u010De nalo\u017Eiti"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49940717588439042
    m_Localized: "Nepri\u010Dakovana napaka pri shranjevanju obroka"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49940717588439043
    m_Localized: "Nepri\u010Dakovana napaka pri posodabljanju obroka"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49940717588439044
    m_Localized: "Skeniraj \u010Drtno kodo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49940717588439045
    m_Localized: "Izdelka za \u010Drtno kodo ni bilo mogo\u010De najti: {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49940717588439046
    m_Localized: "Napaka pri uvozu \u010Drtne kode: {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4008881209995690412
  - m_Id: 50999984831586305
    m_Localized: Prilagodi Foody
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50999984835780608
    m_Localized: Antene
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50999984835780609
    m_Localized: "O\u010Dala"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50999984835780610
    m_Localized: "U\u0161esa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50999984835780611
    m_Localized: Odkleni dodatek
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50999984835780612
    m_Localized: "{0:plural:Ali \u017Eelite odkleniti ta element za {0} FoodyCoin?|Ali
      \u017Eelite odkleniti ta element za {0} FoodyCoina?|Ali \u017Eelite odkleniti
      ta element za {0} FoodyCoine?|Ali \u017Eelite odkleniti ta element za {0} FoodyCoinov?}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4008881209995690412
  - m_Id: 50999984835780613
    m_Localized: Ni dovolj FoodyCoinov
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050452561920
    m_Localized: "\u2696\uFE0F Primerjajte beljakovine z mojega seznama"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950528
    m_Localized: "Primerjava \u017Eivil"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950529
    m_Localized: Odkrijte vpliv tega, kar kupujete, na okolje
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950530
    m_Localized: Skoraj pripravljeni na izziv!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950531
    m_Localized: "Za za\u010Detek tega izziva potrebujete na svojem nakupovalnem
      seznamu vsaj 2 vira beljakovin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950532
    m_Localized: "\U0001F6D2 Pojdi na nakupovalni seznam"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950533
    m_Localized: "\U0001F914 Kaj ima manj\u0161i odtis?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950534
    m_Localized: "Dotaknite se \u017Eivila, za katerega menite, da ima manj\u0161i
      oglji\u010Dni odtis:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950535
    m_Localized: "\U0001F4CA Oglejte si podrobno primerjavo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950536
    m_Localized: "Oglji\u010Dni odtis (kg CO\u2082e/kg)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950537
    m_Localized: Vpliv na okolje PNAS (0-100)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950538
    m_Localized: Podatki ocenjeni na podlagi Clark et al. (PNAS 2022) in svetovnih
      baz podatkov.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51022050460950539
    m_Localized: "\U0001F504 Primerjaj druga \u017Eivila"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178685038592
    m_Localized: "Ribe in morski sade\u017Ei"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232896
    m_Localized: Meso
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232897
    m_Localized: Perutnina
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232898
    m_Localized: "Stro\u010Dnice"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232899
    m_Localized: Rastlinske alternative
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232900
    m_Localized: Jajca
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232901
    m_Localized: Sir
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232903
    m_Localized: Beljakovine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232904
    m_Localized: Pripravljanje dvoboja...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232905
    m_Localized: "\u2696\uFE0F OKOLJSKA PRIMERJAVA"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232908
    m_Localized: "\u26A1 Primerjaj priporo\u010Dene primere"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232909
    m_Localized: OKOLJSKI MINI DVOBOJ
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232910
    m_Localized: "\U0001F331 Manj\u0161i odtis"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232911
    m_Localized: "\U0001F3C6 Manj\u0161i odtis"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232912
    m_Localized: "\U0001F449 Izberi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232913
    m_Localized: VS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232914
    m_Localized: "kg CO\u2082e / kg"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232915
    m_Localized: "{0:F1} kg CO\u2082e"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4008881209995690412
  - m_Id: 51673178689232916
    m_Localized: '{0:F1} / 100'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4008881209995690412
  - m_Id: 51673178689232917
    m_Localized: Pravilno!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232918
    m_Localized: Skoraj!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232919
    m_Localized: "{0} povzro\u010Di pribli\u017Eno {1:F1}-krat manj CO\u2082e kot
      {2} ({3:F1} proti {4:F1} kg CO\u2082e/kg)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4008881209995690412
  - m_Id: 51673178689232920
    m_Localized: "{0} ima nekoliko manj\u0161i odtis kot {1} ({2:F1} proti {3:F1}
      kg CO\u2082e/kg)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4008881209995690412
  - m_Id: 51673178689232921
    m_Localized: Skupni vpliv
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232922
    m_Localized: Eco-Score
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232923
    m_Localized: Nutri-Score
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232924
    m_Localized: Stopnja predelave (NOVA)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232925
    m_Localized: Skupina {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4008881209995690412
  - m_Id: 51673178689232926
    m_Localized: "Znanstveni zaklju\u010Dek"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232927
    m_Localized: "Rastlinski viri beljakovin povzro\u010Dijo 10- do 50-krat manj
      izpustov toplogrednih plinov ter zahtevajo bistveno manj zemlje in vode kot
      rde\u010De meso (Clark et al., PNAS 2022)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232928
    m_Localized: Neposredni podatki (OpenFoodFacts)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232929
    m_Localized: '* Ocena (Clark / Poore et al.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232930
    m_Localized: Goveji burger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232931
    m_Localized: "Kuhana le\u010Da"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232932
    m_Localized: "Pi\u0161\u010Dan\u010Dje prsi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232933
    m_Localized: Trdi tofu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232934
    m_Localized: "Sve\u017E losos"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232935
    m_Localized: Jajca iz proste reje
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44199025098874880
    m_Localized: "Izberi nalogo, da se za\u010Dne\u0161 u\u010Diti in napredovati."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44199294499020800
    m_Localized: "Razi\u0161\u010Di naloge"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232936
    m_Localized: "\u2705 Opravljeno!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232937
    m_Localized: Naredim kasneje
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232938
    m_Localized: "\U0001F4A1 Zakaj je pomembno"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232939
    m_Localized: "Nutri ga bo ozna\u010Dil kot opravljenega, ko ga opravi\u0161 v
      aplikaciji."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232940
    m_Localized: "\u2705 IZZIV OPRAVLJEN"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232941
    m_Localized: "ZA\u010CETNIK"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232942
    m_Localized: SREDNJA RAVEN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232943
    m_Localized: NAPREDNO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232944
    m_Localized: "\U0001F50E Poi\u0161\u010Di ali skeniraj izdelek"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232945
    m_Localized: "\U0001F96B Odpri mojo shrambo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232946
    m_Localized: "\U0001F4D6 Brskaj po receptih"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232947
    m_Localized: "\U0001F4A1 Preberi zanimivost"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232948
    m_Localized: "\U0001F5D1\uFE0F Zabele\u017Ei zavr\u017Eena \u017Eivila"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232949
    m_Localized: "\U0001F5D1\uFE0F Odpri moj dnevnik zavr\u017Eene hrane"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232950
    m_Localized: "\U0001F37D\uFE0F Odpri dnevnik obrokov"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232951
    m_Localized: "\U0001F6D2 Odpri nakupovalni seznam"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232952
    m_Localized: "\u2696\uFE0F Primerjaj \u017Eivila"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232953
    m_Localized: "Najve\u010D: {0} {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232954
    m_Localized: "Katero \u017Eivilo iz shrambe si zavrgel?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232955
    m_Localized: "V shrambi ni ujemajo\u010Dih se \u017Eivil"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232956
    m_Localized: "Prete\u010Dena \u017Eivila"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232957
    m_Localized: "Tvoj dnevnik zavr\u017Eenih \u017Eivil"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232959
    m_Localized: "Izbri\u0161i zapis"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232960
    m_Localized: "Zapis bo izbrisan. \u017Divilo se ne bo vrnilo v shrambo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232961
    m_Localized: Zapis izbrisan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51673178689232962
    m_Localized: "Ta mesec nisi zabele\u017Eil zavr\u017Eenih \u017Eivil"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725672153088
    m_Localized: Zaklenjeno
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347392
    m_Localized: Zaklenjena naloga
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347393
    m_Localized: "Najprej mora\u0161 dokon\u010Dati: {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4008881209995690412
  - m_Id: 52041725676347394
    m_Localized: Nova naloga odklenjena!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347395
    m_Localized: "prej\u0161njo nalogo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347397
    m_Localized: Podrobnosti izdelka
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347398
    m_Localized: "Zabele\u017Ei izbrano"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347399
    m_Localized: '{0} dejavnosti'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4008881209995690412
  - m_Id: 52041725676347400
    m_Localized: "Koliko izdelkov si izbral glede na ve\u010D okoljskih vidikov?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347401
    m_Localized: Pri koliko izdelkih si primerjal skupino NOVA z drugo oceno?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347402
    m_Localized: Pri koliko izdelkih si primerjal Nutri-Score, NOVA in Green-Score?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347403
    m_Localized: Pri koliko izdelkih si preveril skupino NOVA?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347404
    m_Localized: Koliko seznamov sestavin si prebral?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347405
    m_Localized: "Pri koliko izdelkih si preveril podatke o embala\u017Ei?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347406
    m_Localized: "Koliko izdelkov si primerjal z razli\u010Dnimi kazalniki?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347407
    m_Localized: "Kolikokrat si izbral mo\u017Enost za ve\u010Dkratno uporabo (vre\u010Dka,
      posoda, rinfuza)?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347408
    m_Localized: "Koliko izdelkov s pametno embala\u017Eo si na\u0161el?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347409
    m_Localized: "Si na\u010Drtoval obroke za naslednje dni?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347410
    m_Localized: Si pred nakupovanjem preveril hladilnik in shrambo?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347411
    m_Localized: "Koliko razli\u010Dnih rastlinskih \u017Eivil si pojedel ta teden?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347412
    m_Localized: Pri koliko izdelkih si preveril, od kod prihajajo?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347413
    m_Localized: Kolikokrat si izbral izdelek z oznako trajnosti?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347414
    m_Localized: Pri koliko izdelkih si preveril, kako so bili pridelani?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347415
    m_Localized: Pri koliko izdelkih si preveril Green-Score?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347416
    m_Localized: "Pri koliko izdelkih si bil pozoren na material embala\u017Ee?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347417
    m_Localized: Koliko oznak za recikliranje si prebral?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347418
    m_Localized: Pri koliko izdelkih si prebral, kako jih shranjevati?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347419
    m_Localized: "Si primerjal \u017Eivila razli\u010Dnih stopenj predelave NOVA?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347420
    m_Localized: "Pri koliko izdelkih si preveril, ali je embala\u017Ea primerna
      za recikliranje?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347421
    m_Localized: "Si primerjal embala\u017Eo dveh podobnih izdelkov?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347422
    m_Localized: "Katere dni si hrano uredil po na\u010Delu \xBBprvo noter, prvo
      ven\xAB?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347423
    m_Localized: Kaj si preveril in pri koliko izdelkih?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347424
    m_Localized: "Na kaj si bil pozoren pri embala\u017Ei in pri koliko izdelkih?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347425
    m_Localized: Katere vire beljakovin si jedel ta teden?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347426
    m_Localized: Skupina NOVA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347427
    m_Localized: Green-Score
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347428
    m_Localized: "Na\u010Din pridelave"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347429
    m_Localized: Primerjal kazalnike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347430
    m_Localized: Seznam sestavin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347431
    m_Localized: Material
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347432
    m_Localized: Oznaka za recikliranje
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347433
    m_Localized: "Mo\u017Enost za ve\u010Dkratno uporabo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347434
    m_Localized: "Mo\u017Enost recikliranja"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347435
    m_Localized: "\U0001FAD8 Stro\u010Dnice"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347436
    m_Localized: "\U0001F9C0 Mle\u010Dni izdelki"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347437
    m_Localized: "\U0001F95A Jajca"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347438
    m_Localized: "\U0001F41F Ribe"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347439
    m_Localized: "\U0001F95C Ore\u0161\u010Dki"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347440
    m_Localized: "\U0001F33B Semena"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347441
    m_Localized: "\U0001F331 Tofu ali soja"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347442
    m_Localized: "\U0001F357 Pusto meso"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347443
    m_Localized: Sezonski izdelki
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347444
    m_Localized: Lokalni izdelki
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347445
    m_Localized: "Certificirani izdelki (ekolo\u0161ki, pravi\u010Dna trgovina\u2026)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347446
    m_Localized: Z beljakovinami
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347447
    m_Localized: Sadje in zelenjava v mnogih barvah
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347448
    m_Localized: Postregel sem si manj in shranil ostanek
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347449
    m_Localized: Bili so ostanki
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347450
    m_Localized: "Uporabil sem \u017Eivilo po datumu minimalne trajnosti"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347451
    m_Localized: "Katere obroke si imel {0}, o katerih mi \u0161e nisi povedal? Izberi
      jih in mi povej, kaj so vsebovali."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347452
    m_Localized: '{0}: {1} obrok(i)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347453
    m_Localized: "Zabele\u017Eeno, hvala, da si mi povedal! \U0001F64C"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347454
    m_Localized: "Na teko\u010Dem si, trenutno te nimam ni\u010Desar vpra\u0161ati
      \U0001F60A"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347455
    m_Localized: "\u010Ce si to \u017Ee zabele\u017Eil v aplikaciji, mi ni treba
      znova povedati \U0001F609"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347456
    m_Localized: "To bom zabele\u017Eil. Je vse v redu?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347457
    m_Localized: "{0} \u2192 {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347458
    m_Localized: "\u2705 Zabele\u017Ei"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347459
    m_Localized: Danes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347460
    m_Localized: Da
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347461
    m_Localized: Ne
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347462
    m_Localized: "Zabele\u017Eeno! Tvoja misija je na {0} %."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347463
    m_Localized: "Zabele\u017Eeno! Misija opravljena \U0001F389"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347464
    m_Localized: "Odli\u010Dno"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347465
    m_Localized: "\U0001F4AC Povej Nutriju"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347466
    m_Localized: "\U0001F37D\uFE0F Zabele\u017Ei v moj dnevnik obrokov"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347467
    m_Localized: "\u010Ce to zabele\u017Ei\u0161 v aplikaciji, misija napreduje sama."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347468
    m_Localized: Ta misija bo kmalu na voljo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347469
    m_Localized: "Za\u010Dni quest te misije, da bo\u0161 lahko bele\u017Eil napredek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347470
    m_Localized: "\u2705 MISIJA OPRAVLJENA"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347471
    m_Localized: "Pri \xBB{0}\xAB \u0161e ne vidim napredka. Lahko to naredi\u0161
      v aplikaciji ali mi preprosto pove\u0161."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347472
    m_Localized: "Ima\u0161 {0} dni, o katerih mi \u0161e nisi povedal. Bova to nadoknadila
      zdaj?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347473
    m_Localized: Ne zdaj
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347474
    m_Localized: Izvor in sezona
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347475
    m_Localized: "Zavr\u017Eena hrana"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347476
    m_Localized: Samo to, kar potrebujejo moje misije
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347477
    m_Localized: "Ozna\u010Di vsaj eno mo\u017Enost, da se ta obrok zabele\u017Ei."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347478
    m_Localized: "Ni\u010Desar nisi ozna\u010Dil, zato ni ni\u010Desar za bele\u017Eenje.
      Vrni se, \u010De \u017Eeli\u0161 kaj ozna\u010Diti, ali zapri in se sli\u0161iva
      kak drug dan \U0001F60A"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347479
    m_Localized: Zapri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347480
    m_Localized: "Zapre\u0161 brez bele\u017Eenja?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347481
    m_Localized: "Kar si ozna\u010Dil, ne bo zabele\u017Eeno."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347482
    m_Localized: "Del je \u017Ee zabele\u017Een, ostalo pa se bo izgubilo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347483
    m_Localized: Zapri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347484
    m_Localized: "Zna\u010Dke"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347485
    m_Localized: "{0} od {1} zna\u010Dk"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347486
    m_Localized: Pridobljeno {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347487
    m_Localized: Pridobljeno
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347488
    m_Localized: Zaklenjeno
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347489
    m_Localized: "Nova zna\u010Dka!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347490
    m_Localized: Tvoj vpliv
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347491
    m_Localized: "Tvoj vpliv \xB7 {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347492
    m_Localized: Prilagodi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347493
    m_Localized: Vidna kolesa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347494
    m_Localized: Vsa kolesa so skrita.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347495
    m_Localized: "Izpolni kratko anketo in za\u010Dni spremljati svoj vpliv."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347496
    m_Localized: "Za\u010Dni anketo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347497
    m_Localized: '{0:0} %'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347498
    m_Localized: Stopnja {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347499
    m_Localized: '{0:0.##} / {1:0.##} {2}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347500
    m_Localized: Cilj {0:0} %
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347501
    m_Localized: Skupaj {0:0.##} {1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347502
    m_Localized: "Zmanj\u0161anje CO\u2082"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347503
    m_Localized: "Zmanj\u0161anje porabe energije"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347504
    m_Localized: Prihranek vode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347505
    m_Localized: "Manj\u0161a raba zemlji\u0161\u010D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347506
    m_Localized: "kg CO\u2082e"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347507
    m_Localized: kWh
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347508
    m_Localized: L
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347509
    m_Localized: "m\xB2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347510
    m_Localized: "Za\u010Detnik"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347511
    m_Localized: Srednja raven
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347512
    m_Localized: Napredni
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347513
    m_Localized: Prvi koraki
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347514
    m_Localized: "Gradnja bolj\u0161ih navad"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347515
    m_Localized: Ustvarjanje razlike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347516
    m_Localized: Ustvarjanje pozitivnih sprememb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347517
    m_Localized: "Bolj trajnostno \u017Eivljenje"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347518
    m_Localized: Ohranjanje zagona
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347519
    m_Localized: Dosledne trajnostne izbire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347520
    m_Localized: "Pove\u010Devanje tvojega vpliva"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347521
    m_Localized: Spodbujanje pozitivnih sprememb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347522
    m_Localized: Biti zgled drugim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347523
    m_Localized: "Trajnostni \u017Eivljenjski slog"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347524
    m_Localized: "Kar najve\u010Dji vpliv"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347525
    m_Localized: Okoljsko vodstvo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347526
    m_Localized: "Spodbujanje ve\u010Djih sprememb"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347527
    m_Localized: Prvak FOODMISSION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347528
    m_Localized: '{0:0.0} ({1})'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347529
    m_Localized: "Kaj meni\u0161?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347530
    m_Localized: Tapni zvezdico in oceni recept
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347531
    m_Localized: 'Tvoja ocena: {0}/5'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347532
    m_Localized: Odstrani mojo oceno
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347533
    m_Localized: "Ocene ni bilo mogo\u010De shraniti"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347534
    m_Localized: Oceni z {0} od 5
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347535
    m_Localized: "Povpre\u010Dna ocena {0:0.0} od 5 ({1})"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347536
    m_Localized: Vse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347537
    m_Localized: TheMealDB
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347538
    m_Localized: Skupnost
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347539
    m_Localized: 'Vir: TheMealDB'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347540
    m_Localized: "\U0001F465 Recept skupnosti"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347541
    m_Localized: "Neuspe\u0161no"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347542
    m_Localized: "\u274C MISIJA NI USPELA"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347543
    m_Localized: "\u010Cas je potekel ali cilj tokrat ni bil dose\u017Een. Misijo
      lahko znova za\u010Dne\u0161, kadar \u017Eeli\u0161."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347544
    m_Localized: "Tokrat misija {0} ni uspela. Brez skrbi, lahko poskusi\u0161 znova!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347545
    m_Localized: "Za\u010Dni misijo znova"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347546
    m_Localized: "\u017Deli\u0161 to misijo za\u010Deti znova?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347547
    m_Localized: "Napredek te misije bo izbrisan in njeno obdobje se bo za\u010Delo
      znova od danes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347548
    m_Localized: "Odkrito v #FOODMISSION \U0001F331 https://www.foodmission.eu"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347549
    m_Localized: Ali ste vedeli...? Zanimivost iz FOODMISSION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347550
    m_Localized: Iz kviza FOODMISSION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347551
    m_Localized: Deli
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347552
    m_Localized: Deli aplikacijo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347553
    m_Localized: "Pridru\u017Ei se mi v #FOODMISSION \U0001F331 in odkrij, kako jesti
      bolj zdravo in trajnostno. Prenesi aplikacijo tukaj:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347554
    m_Localized: Preizkusi aplikacijo FOODMISSION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347555
    m_Localized: Stik s podporo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347556
    m_Localized: Podpora FOODMISSION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347557
    m_Localized: "Nekatere teme so skrite, ker niso med tvojimi cilji. Posodobi svoje
      cilje, da vidi\u0161 ve\u010D vsebine."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347558
    m_Localized: Uredi moje cilje
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52041725676347559
    m_Localized: "\U0001F4AC Javi se Foodyju"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53932757066178560
    m_Localized: Tvoje ravni
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53932757212979200
    m_Localized: "Na podlagi tvojih odgovorov ti predlagamo to raven za vsako podro\u010Dje.
      Lahko jo obdr\u017Ei\u0161 ali izbere\u0161 svojo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53932757212979201
    m_Localized: "Izberi svojo raven za vsako podro\u010Dje. Vsebina nad tvojo ravnjo
      ostane zaklenjena."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53932757212979202
    m_Localized: Predlagano
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53932757212979203
    m_Localized: Obnovi predlog
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53932757212979204
    m_Localized: Moje ravni
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53932757212979205
    m_Localized: Ta vsebina je ravni {0}. Tvoja raven v {1} je {2}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53932757212979206
    m_Localized: Spremeni moje ravni
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53932757217173504
    m_Localized: Zapri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53959623877582848
    m_Localized: 'Tvoja raven: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389350858752
    m_Localized: "Dokon\u010Dati pozneje?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247360
    m_Localized: "Tvoj profil bo za zdaj ostal nedokon\u010Dan. Kasneje te bom opomnil
      na za\u010Detnem zaslonu, da ga bo\u0161 lahko dokon\u010Dal."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247361
    m_Localized: "Svojih ciljev \u0161e nisi izbral. Kasneje te bom opomnil na za\u010Detnem
      zaslonu, da jih bo\u0161 lahko nastavil."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247362
    m_Localized: "Tvoji odgovori v tej anketi ne bodo shranjeni. Kasneje te bom opomnil
      na za\u010Detnem zaslonu, da jo bo\u0161 lahko izpolnil."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247363
    m_Localized: "Tvoja anketa je \u017Ee shranjena in ohranili bomo predlagane ravni.
      Kadar koli jih lahko spremeni\u0161 v Uredi profil."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247364
    m_Localized: "Dokon\u010Daj pozneje"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247365
    m_Localized: "Preden za\u010Dne\u0161 nalogo, mora\u0161 izpolniti anketo o prehranjevalnih
      navadah. Vzame le minuto in mi pomaga postaviti cilje, ki ti ustrezajo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247366
    m_Localized: Zadnji dan tvoje misije
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247367
    m_Localized: "Danes je zadnji dan, da Nutriju pove\u0161 o \xBB{0}\xAB. Ne izgubi
      svojega napredka!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247368
    m_Localized: "Danes je zadnji dan, da Nutriju pove\u0161 o svojih misijah ({0}).
      Ne izgubi svojega napredka!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247369
    m_Localized: "Danes je zadnji dan misije \xBB{0}\xAB. Povej mi, kaj si naredil,
      da bo \u0161telo!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247370
    m_Localized: "Danes je zadnji dan tvojih misij ({0}). Povej mi, kaj si naredil,
      da bo \u0161telo!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247371
    m_Localized: "Za\u010Deta {0} \xB7 Kon\u010Da se {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247372
    m_Localized: Dan {0} od {1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53972389359247373
    m_Localized: Zadnji dan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
